      "commentary": {
        "paragraphs": [
          "August was the month the regime bet paid.",
          "The strategy returned {{strategy_month_pct}} against {{benchmark_month_pct}} for the {{benchmark_name}}, a {{strategy_month_excess_pp}} beat. Since inception, the numbers are {{strategy_since_inception_pct}} against {{benchmark_since_inception_pct}}.",
          "Most of August's return came from the macro positions built for exactly this kind of financing regime. In late August, the US Treasury doubled the size of its long-end liquidity-support buybacks. Shortly afterward, Fed Chair Kevin Warsh's Jackson Hole speech pushed the market toward a September hike. Fiscal support for the long end arriving alongside a hawkish central bank was the collision those positions were designed to catch. They caught it.",
          "At the same time, the AI buildout kept strengthening. Nvidia printed a record quarter, demand was still described as accelerating, and an initial Talen Energy rung filled after the generation thesis cleared our repricing test.",
          "The financing read worked. The buildout thesis strengthened. And the book was positioned in time for both."
